.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-v2-product-filters-patch - Update filter


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago v2 product-filters patch   [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
PUT and PATCH both accept partial updates. Omitted fields are unchanged. The code cannot change while the product is used by a plan or contract. Values cannot change while a contract has a rate card scoped to this filter.
Supplying values replaces the existing value set. Omitting values preserves it.
Requires the product catalog to be enabled and product write permission on the API key.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--code\fP=""
	Unique code within the organization.

.PP
\fB--description\fP=""
	Internal description.

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for patch

.PP
\fB--input\fP=""
