.PP
\fB--invoice-display-name\fP=""
	Name used on invoices. Defaults to the name when blank.

.PP
\fB--name\fP=""
	Name shown in the catalog.

.PP
\fB--values\fP=""
	Matches against keys of the product billable metric. Cannot be empty.


